        "summary":  "Bank of America has enhanced EricaAssist, its AI tool used by approximately 18,000 customer service employees, with new generative AI capabilities that provide real-time recommendations during customer interactions. The upgrade delivers personalized guidance within seconds, reducing average call times by nearly one minute per interaction. The bank plans to expand EricaAssist to additional business scenarios later this year as part of its roughly $4 billion annual investment in AI and new technology.",
